workflow-app-spine.md lists exactly three current step kinds (research.review, capability.discord.message, review.summary), and CONTEXT.md's Dynamic Workflow Plan entry repeats the same three. The DynamicWorkflowStepSchema discriminated union in src/app/domain/schemas.ts contains a fourth variant, `workflow.node.invoke` (with nodeType, inputRefs, packageRefs, outputPath), which is the entrypoint for the package-backed workflow-node/cartridge execution path. Anyone designing a planner prompt or validating plans from the docs will produce an incomplete step-kind contract.

