The README's Active list documents 11 prototypes but says nothing about cloud-capability-lease-broker-spike, cloudflare-registry-workflow-os-spike, dream-sequence-vision-ui, joelclaw-research-swarm-spike, registry-office-ui-spike, or workflow-observability-spine-spike — including three that have deployed Cloudflare Workers with secrets (capability broker holds GitHub App private key, registry, observability spine). The index that is supposed to make prototypes disposable does not know these exist, which is exactly how dead deployed Workers get forgotten.

