The doc that defines the graduation boundary still describes capsule-do-spike as 'not yet deployed as the production Worker path' and the secret broker as 'not yet connected to real encrypted secret storage or the deployed Worker', while src/app now contains cloudflare-capsule-supervisor.ts (deployed as the CloudflareWorkflowCapsuleSupervisor DO via root wrangler.jsonc), cloudflare-capability-lease-broker.ts, cloudflare-package-registry.ts, cloudflare-review-gate-actor.ts and an app:deploy script. The 'Current prototype receipts' section also stops at the registry spike — workflow-observability-spine-spike, joelclaw-research-swarm-spike, shitrat-dream-workflow-spike, and all three UI spikes are unaccounted for. Anyone using this doc to decide what still needs proving will re-prove shipped seams and miss unproven ones.

