The prototypes index's "Active" list omits six existing spikes: cloud-capability-lease-broker-spike, cloudflare-registry-workflow-os-spike, workflow-observability-spine-spike, joelclaw-research-swarm-spike, registry-office-ui-spike, and dream-sequence-vision-ui. PROTOTYPES.md's deletion contract depends on every prototype having a visible status (active | captured | delete-after) — major proven spikes (the capability broker proof and registry proof are both cited as receipts in docs/dogfood-plan.md and docs/production-vs-prototypes.md) being absent from the index undermines the tombstone/cleanup discipline the repo's own docs mandate.

